{"3348640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TSAREVNA. Age of Tales", "steam_appid": 3348640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/1c2bd470b87f6d53233ec9f9a510a8b2.avif?t=1787325609\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras_big/1c2bd470b87f6d53233ec9f9a510a8b2.webp?t=1787325609 width=1560 height=317 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/e0206604e61844fe6df6d6637a02c8bf.avif?t=1787325609\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras_big/e0206604e61844fe6df6d6637a02c8bf.webp?t=1787325609 width=1560 height=244 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Tsarevna is a story-driven action adventure featuring elegant ballet-inspired hack-and-slash combat in a dark world of Slavic fantasy. Build momentum through elegant combos, rise through combat ranks, and unleash devastating dances that heal wounds, control enemies, or turn the tide of battle. In Tsarevna, fighting beautifully is not just a spectacle…  It is the key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/83dac27d3fe2b5033904df7aa012b8e0.poster.avif?t=1787325609\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/83dac27d3fe2b5033904df7aa012b8e0.webm?t=1787325609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/83dac27d3fe2b5033904df7aa012b8e0.mp4?t=1787325609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/a608808a83be0184cff1f7fe9839c32a.avif?t=1787325609\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras_big/a608808a83be0184cff1f7fe9839c32a.webp?t=1787325609 width=1560 height=244 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore haunting lands, from the fabled island of Buyan to the heavenly realm of Iriy, scarred by a long-forgotten cataclysm. Wander through enchanted forests, forgotten places, and ancient ruins inhabited by creatures drawn from Slavic folklore and timeless fairy tales. Every location is carefully handcrafted to tell its own story, inviting you to uncover forgotten legends, hidden tragedies, and the myths that shaped the kingdom's fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/1e0a662f1961969f0d0ae29c8fb2cfde.poster.avif?t=1787325609\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/1e0a662f1961969f0d0ae29c8fb2cfde.webm?t=1787325609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/1e0a662f1961969f0d0ae29c8fb2cfde.mp4?t=1787325609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/5324692ffb26babd531cd1bf078c992d.avif?t=1787325609\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras_big/5324692ffb26babd531cd1bf078c992d.webp?t=1787325609 width=1560 height=244 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Battle towering bosses, forgotten heroes, and creatures drawn from Slavic folklore. Every encounter is designed to challenge your mastery of combat while revealing another piece of the world's forgotten history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not alone on this journey. Cat Bayun, your sharp-tongued fairytale companion, won't just mock your enemies. He'll tear them apart alongside you. Master devastating tag-team attacks and bring even more style to every battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/e3853d825f6ee03da59bd3080f84096b.poster.avif?t=1787325609\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/e3853d825f6ee03da59bd3080f84096b.webm?t=1787325609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/e3853d825f6ee03da59bd3080f84096b.mp4?t=1787325609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/6d2c05983a361072b07c6ae44325b8d7.avif?t=1787325609\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras_big/6d2c05983a361072b07c6ae44325b8d7.webp?t=1787325609 width=1560 height=244 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Swan is the last surviving heir of a fallen kingdom. Driven by duty and revenge, she begins her journey determined to save her homeland. But every battle leaves its mark. As darkness spreads across the realm, so does the cost of pursuing justice. Witness the transformation of a heroine forced to choose how much of herself she is willing to sacrifice before she becomes the very monster she set out to destroy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/7a4996a742e4afa8f5c68015e7eccd61.poster.avif?t=1787325609\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/7a4996a742e4afa8f5c68015e7eccd61.webm?t=1787325609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/7a4996a742e4afa8f5c68015e7eccd61.mp4?t=1787325609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/c7f29065f7cc65521a8f0c410e497cf2.avif?t=1787325609\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras_big/c7f29065f7cc65521a8f0c410e497cf2.webp?t=1787325609 width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world's first ballet-inspired hack-and-slash based on movements performed by a real prima ballerina</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylish combat featuring combat ranks, air combos, and graceful swordplay </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your weapon transforms in battle: from a razor-sharp sword to a lethal downpour of daggers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich story-driven adventure inspired by well-known Slavic folklore, reimagined in a fresh new way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memorable heroes, companions, and bosses born from forgotten legends, Slavic folklore, and fairy tales</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A handcrafted world you'd like to fight for <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co